cried. "It's a new day, and we have a lot to

54
00:04:20.859 --> 00:04:25.403
do. We'll pick it up where we left off at our last rehearsal on

55
00:04:25.404 --> 00:04:27.558
Wednesday. Places,

56
00:04:27.559 --> 00:04:34.929
everyone!" "That's us," Jade said to her two friends. "You too,

57
00:04:34.930 --> 00:04:39.906
Ben." As Ben followed the three witches, Sonia's foot flew out from under

58
