63
00:04:59.184 --> 00:05:02.288
Winnie came running over. "Are you all right?"

64
00:05:02.289 --> 00:05:06.583
Jade snarled. "My dress is covered in slime!"

65
00:05:06.584 --> 00:05:10.348
Jen bit her lip.

66
00:05:10.349 --> 00:05:14.300
"My hair is slimy now!" Lucy cried.

67
00:05:14.301 --> 00:05:17.304
"What's going on?" Victoria demanded.

68
00:05:17.305 --> 00:05:23.471
"Why does everyone keep slipping on this stage?" Then she gasped.

69
00:05:23.472 --> 00:05:28.313
Glistening lines of slime zigzagged all over the stage.

70
00:05:28.314 --> 00:05:33.881
"Are those . . . slime trails? On my stage?"

71
00:05:33.882 --> 00:05:40.492
Jen sighed. "I'm sorry, Ms. Lafang.

72
00:05:40.493 --> 00:05:47.148
