73
00:05:47.149 --> 00:05:49.833
"I can't help it!"

74
00:05:49.834 --> 00:05:54.732
"Oh, Jen darling!" Victoria draped her arm around Jen.

75
00:05:54.733 --> 00:05:57.864
"You're such a dear little stage manager.

76
00:05:57.865 --> 00:06:02.547
But I simply cannot have my actors slipping all over the stage.

77
00:06:02.548 --> 00:06:06.729
