78
00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:09.156
You understand, don't you?"

79
00:06:09.157 --> 00:06:15.578
Jen nodded. "I won't let you down, Ms. Lafang. And I'll clean up the slime."

80
00:06:15.579 --> 00:06:23.418
"Marvelous. Now let's begin with Ben's entrance onto the stage." Victoria turned to Ben.

81
00:06:23.419 --> 00:06:25.258
"I hope you're ready, Ben.

82
00:06:25.259 --> 00:06:30.205
No pressure, but as the lead character, this entire production rests on your shoulders."

83
00:06:30.206 --> 00:06:34.089
Ben gulped. "I'm ready, Ms. Lafang."

84
00:06:34.090 --> 00:06:41.543
He turned away for a second so she wouldn't see him wiping beads of sweat from his forehead.

